  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span arial=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposal fails to demonstrate how the development would adhere to appropriate energy and sustainability efficiency measures as the proposal has been submitted without an energy and sustainability statement which is a validation requirement and therefore the Local Planning Authority is unable to establish whether the development would be compliant with Policies 85 or 87 of Waltham Forests LP1 (2024).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span arial=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposed development which involves the sub-division of no.14 Shaw Square would result in insufficient, sub-standard external amenity space for the existing and future occupiers of no.14 Shaw Square. The development would be contrary to D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policy 56 of Waltham Forests LP1 (2024).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
